      "claims_checked": [
        "Fixed paired action-observation traces lead to task-general operating rules.",
        "Sequential SKILL.md patches persist for disjoint later evaluation tasks while weights stay fixed.",
        "Sample procedural instructions cover tool use, output verification, stopping and alternate-action retry.",
        "Default consolidator adds no environment calls or post-patch evaluation-based acceptance; alternative SkillOpt validation is separated."
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "section": "S3",
          "quote": "No stage computes a gradient or requires access to the parameters of either model.",
          "normalized_section_offset": 129,
          "section_text_sha256": "8f9ae2a5a6bd00efe4283a37050257ebeaf27b87291f7672b155734685c75ab9"
        },
        {
          "section": "S3.SS2",
          "quote": "Once the trajectories have been collected, D-Skill operates fully offline",
          "normalized_section_offset": 1248,
          "section_text_sha256": "5b196510f47c7f38d14b1625f5d311b23b9864fb77218cde798dd58df9d800b0"
        },
        {
          "section": "S3.SS3",
          "quote": "Each lesson must cite concrete evidence from the paired traces and express a task-general principle rather than an instance-specific correction.",
          "normalized_section_offset": 894,
          "section_text_sha256": "68e2af0ab07099e24f71b3cb13b7e37c16297733429fcd22b43bf7288d4e547f"
        },
        {
          "section": "S3.SS4",
          "quote": "Finally, in the apply phase, the merged patch is deterministically incorporated into the current skill before the next chunk is processed.",
          "normalized_section_offset": 857,
          "section_text_sha256": "9aa34408cd0e33f234a23c469a2cb86a30f2885317f316cc02c9a8c96fee2759"
        },
        {
          "section": "S4.SS0.SSS0.Px1",
          "quote": "200 tasks form a held-out evaluation set",
          "normalized_section_offset": 303,
          "section_text_sha256": "295bba75762adb4a3596762dc3bd08445c4b98c596419c2912cf8a0abd3e9e24"
        },
        {
          "section": "S4.SS2.SSS0.Px3",
          "quote": "The SkillOpt-backed variant retains SkillOpt’s held-out validation gate.",
          "normalized_section_offset": 171,
          "section_text_sha256": "337517ebb901ca0303aa7deaac7a91449cb2fb8d03da77b419d22a3b13594eb1"
        },
        {
          "section": "A4.SSx1",
          "quote": "Only call TASK_COMPLETE after this check passes.",
          "normalized_section_offset": 806,
          "section_text_sha256": "b50613320ad5fdd2a94666094c1d0b1d565bbe757bff75b5ef9d3bea9c88e2f2"
        },
        {
          "section": "A4.SSx2",
          "quote": "If an observation does not advance progress toward the goal, immediately switch to a different admissible action",
          "normalized_section_offset": 3144,
          "section_text_sha256": "153c61892283f52a4924484e12d57d83eb970864a4302c9852db11736ee20b86"
        }
